# Store text as LF in the repository. Without this, a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true materialises CRLF and every file then reports as modified
# forever. Listed per extension so binary assets are never touched.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.svg  text eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
